Section: 5.1 Dataset and Setting
Text: 5.1 Dataset and Setting To the best of our knowledge, there is no publicly available dataset for table retrieval. We introduce WebQueryTable, an open-domain dataset con- sisting of query-table pairs. We use search logs from a commercial search engine to get a list of queries that could be potentially answered by web tables. Each query in query logs is paired with a list of web pages, ordered by the number of user clicks for the query.

Rank: 17
Source: 1706.02427.pdf
